{
  "name": "gbt-potato-desktop",
  "productName": "GBT小土豆V8",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "GBT小土豆V8 · 一体式桌面壳（以 DeepSeek Harness 的对话面为底层，只做加法、不改它一行）",
  "license": "UNLICENSED",
  "main": "shell/main.cjs",
  "scripts": {
    "start": "electron .",
    "test": "node --test tests/test_*.cjs",
    "preflight": "electron shell/preflight.cjs",
    "guard": "py -3.14 ../tools/codex-scripts/desktop-shell-guard.py",
    "rehearse": "electron shell/rehearse.cjs",
    "startup": "electron shell/startup.cjs",
    "interact": "electron shell/interact.cjs",
    "shots": "electron shell/shots.cjs",
    "scan:leak": "py -3.14 ../tools/codex-scripts/exposure-scan.py",
    "pack": "electron-builder --win --dir",
    "dist": "electron-builder --win"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "electron": "43.0.0"
  },

  "comment_deps": "壳只 require `electron` 一个外部包（其余是 node 内建 + 本地 ./xxx.cjs）。本机已有全局 electron v43.0.0 可用；`npm install` 只有在要**锁定版本、离线打包**时才需要 —— 装包属于闸二，须先问主人。",

  "comment_build": "electron-builder 配置（2026-09-23 补，同日第 40 轮**修**）。**为什么原来没有**：那一版只做到了 `npm start`（开发跑），从没配过打包 —— 于是「打包上线」这条一直是**空的**。",
  "comment_build_schema": "🔴 2026-09-23 第 40 轮实测的坑：**electron-builder 26.15.3 对 `build` 做严格 schema 校验，未知属性直接拒**。我原先把注释写成 `\"// files\"` / `\"// asar\"` 这类键塞在 `build` 里 ⇒ 一跑 `npm run pack` 就报 `configuration has an unknown property '// files'`，**外加 `configuration.win should be one of these: null`**（`build.win` 里也塞了个 `// note`）。⇒ 规矩定死：**注释一律放 `build` 外面**（本文件的 `comment_*` 顶层键）。机检：`npm run preflight` 的 `K:ebconfig` 格。",
  "comment_build_files": "**白名单制**：只打壳自己 + 它真要读的东西。绝不用默认的「整目录收」—— 那会把 node_modules 与仓库别处一起塞进包里。",
  "comment_build_files_negations": "🔴 2026-09-23 第 35 轮补的两条负规则（`!eye/frames/**` 与 `!eye/frames.js`）：`eye/**/*` 会把**触手拍的整屏截图**一起打进安装包。`.gitignore` 早就排除了它们，但**打包白名单从来没跟它同步过** —— 打出来的 App 会带着主人的桌面截图分发。机检：`npm run preflight` 的 `K:packsrc` 格 + `tests/test_pack_windows.cjs`。",
  "comment_build_extraResources": "补上 `files` 里的通配覆盖不到的顶层件（预检/守卫要用到的）：本壳**不打包 holo_pet/**（那是面板服务，属于本机运行态，不是壳的产物）。",
  "comment_build_asar": "**不开 asar**：壳的预检/守卫要靠 `require` 与 `fs` 直接读壳内文件（`windows.json`、各个 `*.html`），打成 asar 后这些路径语义会变。宁可包大一点，换取「打包后行为与开发态一致」。",
  "comment_build_win": "先出 **portable 单文件**（免安装、免签名）：本机没有代码签名证书，出 nsis 安装包会被 SmartScreen 拦。签名是**主人的事**，不是我能补的。",
  "comment_build_electronDist": "🔴 离线打包用：本机**没有** electron-builder 的下载缓存（`%LOCALAPPDATA%\\electron-builder\\Cache` 不存在），而它默认要从 GitHub 下 `electron-v43.0.0-win32-x64.zip`。全局 electron 的 `dist/` 已在盘上（224.8 MB）⇒ 指过去就能离线出包，也**不必联网**。",
  "comment_build_electronVersion": "🔴 2026-09-23 第 40 轮实测第二坑：electron-builder **拒收版本区间** —— `\"electron\": \"^43.0.0\"` 会报「Electron version \"^43.0.0\" is a range, not a fixed version … a range cannot be resolved without electron installed in node_modules」。本壳**故意不装 node_modules**（走全局 electron）⇒ 必须显式给 `electronVersion`。写 `43.0.0` 的依据是现读：`electron --version` → `v43.0.0`。区间与定值**两处必须一致**，否则将来 `npm install` 拉到的 43.x 与打包用的不是同一个。",

  "build": {
    "appId": "com.gbtxiaotudou.desktop.v8",
    "productName": "GBT小土豆V8",
    "copyright": "开发者：自由的风 · GBT小土豆V8 · 本署名不可删除、不可篡改归属",
    "electronVersion": "43.0.0",
    "electronDist": "C:/Users/ADMIN/AppData/Roaming/npm/node_modules/electron/dist",
    "directories": {
      "output": "../dist"
    },
    "files": [
      "shell/**/*",
      "*.html",
      "*.css",
      "*.js",
      "*.cjs",
      "brain/**/*",
      "plugins-mesh/**/*",
      "code-deck/**/*",
      "exec-deck/**/*",
      "eigenflux/**/*",
      "eye/**/*",
      "h1/**/*",
      "build/**/*",
      "tests/**/*",
      "package.json",
      "!**/__pycache__/**",
      "!**/*.map",
      "!eye/frames/**",
      "!eye/frames.js"
    ],
    "extraResources": [
      { "from": "../tools/codex-scripts", "to": "tools/codex-scripts", "filter": ["desktop-shell-guard.py", "vendor_three.py", "audit_skin.py", "deepseek_bridge.py"] }
    ],
    "win": {
      "target": [
        { "target": "portable", "arch": ["x64"] }
      ],
      "icon": "build/icon.ico"
    },
    "asar": false,
    "compression": "normal"
  },
  "author": "自由的风 · GBT小土豆V8",
  "signature": "本署名不可删除、不可篡改归属"
}
